"""One-shot synthetic closure-assembly probe for exact full_body_spec_v1.

This diagnostic is non-qualifying. It performs a bounded closure projection,
but no control/trajectory optimization; it changes no model data and calls
constrained acceleration only after explicit gates pass.
"""
